<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aetrium raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aetrium raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth Inc said Thursday it raised its rating on Aetrium Inc to buy from hold, with a 12-month price target of $20 a share.  </p>
<p>-- The change was based on the beginning of positive turnaround signs for the semiconductor industry the company serves, new product development efforts, a strong balance sheet and an attractive valuation, Dain Bosworth said.</p>
<p>-- Aetrium shares were up 1/2 at 13-3/4 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
